# Real official insurer source documents are downloaded, not committed —
# redistribution permission for third-party insurer PDFs is unclear (see
# docs/DATA_PROVENANCE_AUDIT.md §8). The manifest (URLs, checksums,
# retrieval metadata — no insurer content) is the exception: it's what
# makes the documents reproducible without redistributing them. Git
# requires each ancestor directory to be un-ignored too, hence the chain.
!backend/data/
!backend/data/source_documents/
backend/data/source_documents/*
!backend/data/source_documents/MANIFEST.json
